# Safety arbiter parameter delta for the LUX F765 (ArduCopter 4.7.1).
# Load only after a fresh full backup from the vehicle. Previous values are in
# the comments (from params/LUXF765_QGC_READONLY_2026-09-20.param - re-verify live).
#
# S1/S2 become Lua-driven. With no script running they sit at SERVO9/10_TRIM
# (1500 us): the ESP32 holds an existing ARMED and inhibits radio FIRE.
SERVO9_FUNCTION,94
# was 145 (RCIN6Scaled / SB)
SERVO10_FUNCTION,95
# was 148 (RCIN9Scaled / SE)
#
# Unchanged and relied on (fallback values): SERVO9_TRIM 1500, SERVO10_TRIM 1500,
# SERVO9/10_MIN 1100, SERVO9/10_MAX 1900, SCR_ENABLE 1, MAV_GCS_SYSID 255.
#
# ESP32 status UART (receive only). SERIAL2 = UART5: "RX5" pad, bottom edge.
SERIAL2_PROTOCOL,28
# was -1
SERIAL2_BAUD,115
# was 57
#
# LUX <-> Pi MAVLink link for the mesh. SERIAL1 = USART1: "TX1"/"RX1" pads,
# bottom-right edge. 115200 suits the Pi Zero 2 W mini-UART.
SERIAL1_PROTOCOL,2
# was -1
SERIAL1_BAUD,115
# was 57
